    <string name="help_map_title">The map</string>
    <string name="help_map">Tap a road to see what it is, or a favourite section to open its card. The buttons on the map:</string>
    <string name="help_plan_title">Plan a ride</string>
    <string name="help_plan">Long-press a place to start there, then long-press where you want to go. Pull a route’s or loop’s card up for its choices, like avoiding your favourites to find new roads. The place’s card can also route or loop from where you are, and a route or loop can be shared or saved:</string>
    <string name="help_sections_title">Favourite sections</string>
    <string name="help_sections">Tap where a road you like starts and where it ends, then rate it good, great or epic: routes and loops lean towards your favourite sections. Pick one in Favourite sections to see it, then loop through it or route through it from where you are.</string>
    <string name="help_ride_title">On a ride</string>
    <string name="help_library_title">Routes and rides</string>
    <string name="help_ride">Record your ride, and tag roads you like as you pass them. After the ride, review each tagged spot: it may be a road you want to save as a favourite section.</string>
    <string name="help_settings_title">Ride settings</string>
    <string name="help_settings">The gear on the map opens them, in three groups:</string>
